        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "b9ca4572-feb4-5c97-a3ac-08f0cf835c39",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ronnie Radke, Dave Brockie\n- Bands: Gwar, Death Piggy, X-Cops, Dave Brockie Experience, Falling in Reverse, Escape the Fate\n- Tours: Bury the Hatchet Tour\n- TV Shows: Holliston\n\nFacts:\n- David Murray Brockie was born on August 30, 1963, and he was a Canadian musician.\n- Ronald Joseph Radke was born on December 15, 1983, in Las Vegas, Nevada, and he is an American singer, songwriter, entertainer, and record producer.\n- Dave Brockie was best known as the lead vocalist of the metal band Gwar, where he performed as Oderus Urungus.\n- Dave Brockie also performed as a bassist and lead singer in Death Piggy, X-Cops, and the Dave Brockie Experience.\n- Dave Brockie starred in the comedy-horror TV sitcom \"Holliston\" as Oderus Urungus.\n- Dave Brockie died on March 23, 2014.\n- The Bury the Hatchet Tour was notable because it was the first time Falling in Reverse and Escape the Fate joined forces after Falling in Reverse lead singer Ronnie Radke was kicked from Escape the Fate.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "7006d20d-384c-5b67-b8c5-12b832fa42d8",
        "text": "Page: Ronnie Radke. Sentence: Ronald Joseph Radke (born December 15, 1983) is an American singer, songwriter, entertainer, and record producer born in Las Vegas, Nevada.\nPage: Dave Brockie. Sentence: David Murray Brockie (August 30, 1963 – March 23, 2014), was a Canadian musician, and best known as the lead vocalist of the metal band Gwar, in which he performed as Oderus Urungus.\nPage: Dave Brockie. Sentence: He performed as a bassist and lead singer in bands such as Death Piggy, X-Cops, and the Dave Brockie Experience (DBX), and starred in the comedy/horror TV sitcom \"Holliston\" as Oderus Urungus.\nPage: Bury the Hatchet Tour. Sentence: The tour was notable because this was the first time the two bands joined forces, after Falling in Reverse lead singer Ronnie Radke was kicked from Escape the Fate.",
